_gnmkNRJ2VbA42nZjgb7IPsQBnbPF6mgjoQf3s58FdN-Og0MtOSSsnqrhzLnDhKhohBwL0t8oiUdmnHkNWC2Q","share_title":"Material Design Blog - Discover the latest about Material"},"description":"Read the latest and greatest about Material Design"},{"slug":"components/carousel","metadata":{"keywords":"Material, Material Design, Google Material, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, Material Design Components, Material Components, components, carousel","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Carousels show a collection of items that can be scrolled on and off the screen. Contain visual items like images or video, along with optional label text.","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Lhbh9uQp12eLXYQQxLl1F_mns62kBTEjWYFf1LYTZqIrv4hDh_JUSdRf84eiELD9pcGcGHdcyCxfur94CIsoc0zprIGoNFP-yYFKcywX76_iei0Fdvc","share_title":"Carousel \u2013 Material Design 3"},"description":null},{"slug":"components/divider","metadata":{"keywords":"Material, Material Design, Google Material, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, Material Design Components, Material Components, components, cards","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"A divider is a thin line that groups content in lists and containers.","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/8XE8z8nXQKQUenlC67jMRhDdJzHNpRPOb8823ZEjppX7lG4H9KGw8E-NgAdPL9IVpjU0SjUMKM4HquiaaC1C7QkwOsq7lTbm5sDE5Ki0qgcVa6aByag","share_title":"Divider \u2013 Material Design 3"},"description":"A divider is a thin line that groups content in lists and containers."},{"slug":"components/navigation-bar","metadata":{"keywords":"Material, Material Design, Google Material, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, Material Design Components, Material Components, components, navigation bar, navigation, bottom nav","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Navigation bars let people switch between UI views on smaller devices. They\u2019re a common navigation component on handheld screens.","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/n4J4Jub0Z8mMwpNmj68TF-0f6P8_KfxJPC_mVwKxeTLPAyCRKcovkuDTDSzgixYrZA04rWDtKb4iUYlvQXhyS1niYwNnPa9Cr-zzyLsOWzU1eSCpIA","share_title":"Navigation bar \u2013 Material Design 3"},"description":null},{"slug":"components/floating-action-button","metadata":{"keywords":"Material, Material Design, Google Material, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, Material Design Components, Material Components, components, fab, fabs, floating action buttons","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Floating action buttons (FABs) help people take primary actions. They\u2019re used to represent the most important action on a screen, such as Create or Reply.","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Hw0sslK5sGrGpnxb9hsvdsGJ0mIEzpIwbx1SyM7s-XAiu136AGItSHA5FbtiqtlsNrhCa7rgqSykcayLLh0rfhlA3Nk9un0yaTNtl9VyjthYXJywXm2H","share_title":"FAB \u2013 Material Design 3"},"description":null},{"slug":"components/progress-indicators","metadata":{"keywords":"Progress indicators, Material, Material Design, Google Material, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, Material Design Components, Material Components, components","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Progress indicators inform users about the status of ongoing processes, such as loading an app. It show the status of a process in real time.","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/v1cUW72XHWnx_Bo8u7jeLlR96xuUPPqAM22BIk3XouqTuxAWAIoRIvFqYqKSM3NrFQSkKWX-HqNvddGl6pTOAM88Hni6K49TA0VBFOLa1fSo0MK1bew","share_title":"Progress indicators \u2013 Material Design 3"},"description":null},{"slug":"components/navigation-drawer","metadata":{"keywords":"Material, Material Design, Google Material, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, Material Design Components, Material Components, components, navigation drawer, navigation","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Navigation drawers let people switch between UI views on larger devices. Navigation drawers provide access to destinations in your app.","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/KW-2sMX9xpyX8ebSlKw431RiEykFgS90SJms8kfWusCoMrEaQMYNyytsHlCAZVoWS8jUjUOA-IRnXIIGBT6fB7yNFh16KYqc45tm9C8fqLqwYCPvIvc","share_title":"Navigation drawer \u2013 Material Design 3"},"description":null},{"slug":"components/extended-fab","metadata":{"keywords":"Material, Material Design, Google Material, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, Material Design Components, Material Components, components, extended fab, extended fabs, extended floating action buttons, fab, fabs","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Extended floating action buttons (extended FABs) help people take primary actions, just like FABs. They\u2019re wider than FABs and include a text label, providing more detail and a larger target surface.","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/W709DD7h3NdXzkYi80bp3EdAW-lKHkEnv_Pef4ATcNYo-HnszNIIZQLnVXt-7OXQrrgOSNsXEfz_gBxpDfBSicdU46Y-SnORIRJXPtE6zigaJEXM7UA","share_title":"Extended FAB \u2013 Material Design 3"},"description":null},{"slug":"components/tooltips","metadata":{"keywords":"Material, Material Design, Google Material, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, Material Design Components, Material Components, components, tooltips","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Tooltips display brief labels or messages. Tooltips are informative, specific, and action-oriented text labels that provide contextual support","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/lJM3Eft4qYA2-u8hGts3octhkDMZxRC1yHOnmzOn9CfZGAm7DImHyZyZqvu1YnF7fYICpR5WFWJGyi2gqt3ydxG9QBRqUA2Zz7qiDIHLvQ3QO-1lOog","share_title":"Tooltips \u2013 Material Design 3"},"description":null},{"slug":"components/checkbox","metadata":{"keywords":"Checkbox, Material, Material Design, Google Material, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, Material Design Components, Material Components, components","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Checkboxes let users select one or more items from a list, or turn an item on or off.","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aU_5afl5gGlvkbfrZbNt8vLxHxTXGm9EnzkEUsov69ZMUQ_Rjtm96HsJdAfX5RlSrsvrS9inZbRErHC2mjLzMtXeeUgmUy7JyOdFbif-wN8zY_RFRks","share_title":"Checkbox \u2013 Material Design 3"},"description":"Checkboxes allow users to select one or more items from a set. Checkboxes can turn an option on or off."},{"slug":"components/toolbars","metadata":{"keywords":"Material, Material Design, Google Material, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, Material Design Components, Material Components, components, toolbars, Toolbars","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Toolbars display frequently used actions relevant to the current page","share_image":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/design-spec/o/projects%2Fm3%2Fimages%2Fmrokzcly-Toolbar.png?alt=media&token=50e8f161-0bc1-4766-a098-134272b8d585=w1800-rj","share_title":"Toolbars \u2013 Material Design 3"},"description":"Toolbars display frequently used actions relevant to the current page."},{"slug":"components/buttons","metadata":{"keywords":"Material, Material Design, Google Material, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, Material Design Components, Material Components, components, buttons","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Buttons help people take action, such as sending an email, sharing a document, or liking a comment. Common buttons prompt most actions in a UI.","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/iu0ghCr65S7lOuzD1FyNaql_XMiItRV2chZ8KPzCdE_ydVb8vS3GT25DnbVWTIsMYO4upfZyJim6urOt1cm8kOOGKeIYqX3Wbl1agO3BZfPgYOSJcw","share_title":"Buttons \u2013 Material Design 3"},"description":"Buttons help people take action, such as sending an email, sharing a document, or liking a comment. Common buttons prompt most actions in a UI."},{"slug":"components/badges","metadata":{"keywords":"Badge, Material, Material Design, Google Material, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, Material Design Components, Material Components, components","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Badges show notifications, counts, or status information on navigation items and icons.  A badge can include labels or numbers.","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/jTOaIAaN8d0Hwa7vnfG1biZu2gTDNbwTTihNDf3O5_Bxq_CfF11D5UV1LHvPLTVcJyuXyvixK-4fg-HKz1M-UHpuo5VlVWYjqKsVWtmXaqUDfXOWGg","share_title":"Badge \u2013 Material Design 3"},"description":"Badges are used as indicators to convey dynamic information, such as counts or status. A badge can include labels or numbers."},{"slug":"components/snackbar","metadata":{"keywords":"Material, Material Design, Google Material, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, Material Design Components, Material Components, components, snackbars","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Snackbars show short updates about app processes at the bottom of the screen. They can disappear or remain on screen until the user takes action.","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/MCljoGyPcLqjCzgUIbJLevRR157ih2wAieRDwAlhNvtaivJj4aSqeUrEXcR2PkahZD8sd2S-0Uges5TYVUSOZOGqzL68SZdr9DDd2QvythX8orW1HHJ5","share_title":"Snackbar - Material Design 3"},"description":"Snackbars provide brief messages about app processes at the bottom of the screen."},{"slug":"components/navigation-rail","metadata":{"keywords":"Material, Material Design, Google Material, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, Material Design Components, Material Components, components, navigation rail, navigation","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Navigation rails let people switch between UI views on mid-sized devices. They can contain 3-7 destinations plus an optional FAB.","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/KqqwKGiGfJCWHJWGsrQHkJBLSbY73iXVlD9VhRbarTDDCbN870mBCFyDm9F8zqx8DeREGmWfa8mGHwywwrQK2lJu8RwspT51QfiuF25J6dF7KS3qo-E","share_title":"Navigation rail \u2013 Material Design 3"},"description":"Navigation rails let people switch between UI views on mid-sized devices. They can contain 3-7 destinations plus an optional FAB."},{"slug":"components/side-sheets","metadata":{"keywords":"Material, Material Design, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, Material Design Components, Material Components, components, cards","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Side sheets show secondary content anchored to the side of the screen. There are two types: standard and modal.","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/n8fIOtVTaebce3t16v7jMRN1-sL2Xj13DBTxPiQA3tLczCD_Za-MdXw5wAoGOpoczWBOCeCndDrJCaUKYA4rhL019LE453WkY4c9wR8udXgv__WX-Q","share_title":"Side sheets \u2013 Material Design 3"},"description":"Side sheets are surfaces containing supplementary content or actions to support tasks as part of a flow."},{"slug":"components/bottom-sheets","metadata":{"keywords":"Material, Material Design, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, Material Design Components, Material Components, components, cards","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Bottom sheets show secondary content anchored to the bottom of the screen. There are two types of bottom sheets: standard and modal.","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/anRizsTTKb3ZFDxvaOQnGhnaepLiJtk__kY2eOG1-X9tBEOZ_Efjd8vHU14mujMBUuRZXdKZjW6kZp32adjusmMOSOrgzXKXqvJHUUkEDF9C-tteNDyQ","share_title":"Bottom sheets \u2013 Material Design 3"},"description":"Bottom sheets are surfaces containing supplementary content, anchored to the bottom of the screen."},{"slug":"components/cards","metadata":{"keywords":"Material, Material Design, Google Material, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, Material Design Components, Material Components, components, cards","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Cards display content and actions about a single subject. Explore three types: elevated, filled and outlined.","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/wN0u_0s9DujWzdKZlthDs80f4hCuXzU3GjK9hjJTmJoVxjtsU1av94BfcBJxrkIPPHyAo2Ym9_V3yyFCDvh7kSja9Xdiye0JtgctblHKQl3Rs0kapP0","share_title":"Cards \u2013 Material Design 3"},"description":"Cards display content and actions about a single subject."},{"slug":"components/menus","metadata":{"keywords":"Material, Material Design, Google Material, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, Material Design Components, Material Components, components, menus","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Menus display a list of choices on a temporary surface. Menus can open from a variety of components, including icon buttons and text fields.","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/eL0VqKowoWoyad9XeiEkCH_Z07uvihWBuQdxkFAW_Nqgs56RqYsknQb3955D1ivkyjqQpqC_UrfjcSGYlEicvokGdB3KnRWVrEUwcAsl0BY2lDp5WSw","share_title":"Menus \u2013 Material Design 3"},"description":null},{"slug":"components/button-groups","metadata":{"keywords":"Material, Material Design, Google Material, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, Material Design Components, Material Components, components, button groups","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Button groups organize buttons and add interactions between them","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/yHacNSBWhhtbC944LRmPg_s-4gSjPOgJFj2qf5EzdaYV3Ol5rTNoGgAUn14a2GDIm31hDHdKc9mxO6yX6sdSscoO4x_mH7677V_mnlRonAo_WspsGS4=w1800","share_title":"Button groups"},"description":"Button groups organize buttons and add interactions between them"},{"slug":"components/split-button","metadata":{"keywords":"Material, Material Design, Google Material, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, Material Design Components, Material Components, components, split button","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Split buttons open a menu to give people more options related to an action","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/M8XsqmeTn2jgy7srjlfRDU_uqy6XEh754ELjK3dY2FFn4JmVWRU_vs3opnrZBI1c1n4vErm_mtJ42vvLfV6vJFfw7RNA0fHXQM0iw_cpk_rXS4rSwYI=w1800","share_title":"Split buttons"},"description":"Split buttons combine a primary action with a secondary action in a single component."},{"slug":"components/radio-button","metadata":{"keywords":"Radio button, Material, Material Design, Google Material, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, Material Design Components, Material Components, components","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Radio buttons let people select one option from a set of options. Use radio buttons (not switches) when only one item can be selected from a list.","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/RKWgcABIrCHrrGhFi6_duV8zcWSY1nscgia4GD9DNgEPPjQ4-FtpeneiI0NLKi8SPqIivalSBu_0SpJj9ru3B9l57uhJoGkL2GfhqGSk2MZvpy9KdA","share_title":"Radio button \u2013 Material Design 3"},"description":"Radio buttons allow users to select one option from a set."},{"slug":"components/all-buttons","metadata":{"keywords":"Material, Material Design, Google Material, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, Material Design Components, Material Components, components, buttons","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Buttons let people take action and make choices with one tap. Explore button types: elevated, filled, filled tonal, outlined, text, icon, segmented & more.","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/bgnKHvrZ8Hv2bYR_gjC_Qmyl9HLS3rvGPbMVu0K8oTj3et0BcNL9O7H3E7cU6u_mKQ9t3UiJRzW7jWAVuIlzxWdnByKRuLn46vyNkur53davmxMdtt4","share_title":"All buttons \u2013 Material Design 3"},"description":"Buttons let people take action and make choices with one tap."},{"slug":"components/sliders","metadata":{"keywords":"Slider, Sliders, Material, Material Design, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, Material Design Components, Material Components, components","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Sliders let users make selections from a range of values. There are four configurations: continuous, discrete, centered, range selection.","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/OWwb77SjGqjZQLsDqlw0d2LHmx7E1Edw9pc7X8Xk2lA7AUQ1nRcjpOR76wXmHgqC77ZCpt_5cjRsC9NziAqGQSqdTRTR2wMqXLYcfRB9EbfCWaw8ew","share_title":"Sliders \u2013 Material Design 3"},"description":"Sliders let users make selections from a range of values. There are four configurations: continuous, discrete, centered, range selection."},{"slug":"components/tabs","metadata":{"keywords":"Material, Material Design, Google Material, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, Material Design Components, Material Components, components, navigation bar, navigation, bottom nav","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Tabs organize content across different screens, data sets, and other interactions. Use tabs to group content into helpful categories.","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/8U59FOnr9wjH8Eux1lxzMUQoMOAuE32q0p8r08sC-4xWBEPfll7iHC452ku9B-z52zHiKIxvHYRgUnFvx1skxdayGMgCPDoxkeYmEPCDvOIhnH6BSV8","share_title":"Tabs \u2013 Material Design 3"},"description":"Tabs organize content across different screens, data sets, and other interactions."},{"slug":"components/segmented-buttons","metadata":{"keywords":"Segmented button, Material, Material Design, Google Material, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, Material Design Components, Material Components, components","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Segmented buttons help people select options, switch views, or sort elements. Segmented buttons can contain icons, label text, or both.","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/D-8dyCWQ3sxdEzNoL4MW-4aX_TSHE0F_wrF40y4bTsKTbVY6mN86qdTP_lmiTwpu0HhzzajqYj1VAT6T111t4Z1adVaaXwdfQkrXJC7eL0cfENUyfAA","share_title":"Segmented button \u2013 Material Design 3"},"description":"Segmented buttons help people select options, switch views, or sort elements."},{"slug":"components/date-pickers","metadata":{"keywords":"Date picker, Material, Material Design, Google Material, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, Material Design Components, Material Components, components","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Date pickers let people select a date, or a range of dates. Date pickers can display past, present, or future dates.","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/YMcDQwccIYdZQCclnmL3BQj8juhrhmwZnKP5tOPuggWxqQp1nUwzSiM2kb452O-rXM93BVfEwbrCTylv12DZ4dj1d4CjlfA1jUVK_wLWhGvpsUXl7A","share_title":"Date pickers \u2013 Material Design 3"},"description":"Date pickers let people select a date, or a range of dates. Date pickers can display past, present, or future dates."},{"slug":"components/lists","metadata":{"keywords":"Material, Material Design, Google Material, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, Material Design Components, Material Components, components, cards","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Lists are continuous, vertical indexes of text and images. Use lists to help users find a specific item and act on it.","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/D9kmD7TGeuB3-racv1SUAJPNK6hFXZzfnfcOhHyzg-4FcKKoy-aIL4il04fdYgJi8na-_bLRZF3qVdlruFys4Fq-yli1oiK03dm3VvKjy7c0xgAv40nq","share_title":"Lists \u2013 Material Design 3"},"description":"Lists are continuous, vertical indexes of text or images."},{"slug":"components/switch","metadata":{"keywords":"Switch, Material, Material Design, Google Material, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, Material Design Components, Material Components, components","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Switches toggle the selection of an item on or off. Switches are the best way to let users adjust settings.","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/TVArYuECyDwSc7viB8VaKpMF6_1i36n-BJU7qP6MQcrz0ue1UuV_jw6lBHVOMNmfhII-C3KuYFrV4HbGE2gkSQgk70OHhMuOhC9Nwb2NytDRU-rolSg","share_title":"Switch \u2013 Material Design 3"},"description":"Switches toggle the selection of an item on or off. Switches are the best way to let users adjust settings."},{"slug":"components/search","metadata":{"keywords":"Search, Search bar, Material, Material Design, Google Material, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, Material Design Components, Material Components, components","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Search lets people enter a keyword or phrase to get relevant information. Search bars can display suggested keywords or phrases as the user types.","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/7EJCMuog77nY8-ki87RYJLmAIM742wl7oexjfN0SnDatOv9SG_LRPxt4A0fwtiLaTYED_9bIaSWUIuLdZYJZYi6gdI3uAZCnxOz_YVpB5xYef7W64YU","share_title":"Search \u2013 Material Design 3"},"description":"Search lets people enter a keyword or phrase to get relevant information. Search bars can display suggested keywords or phrases as the user types."},{"slug":"components/icon-buttons","metadata":{"keywords":"Icon button toggle, Material, Material Design, Google Material, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, Material Design Components, Material Components, components","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Icon buttons help people take supplementary actions with a single tap. They\u2019re used when a compact button is required, such as in a toolbar or image list.","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/wWaldqQ0mhWU14C293h0J8vXBsR7QwHviA_kZ4KpeDNPnwWk9h7FXRybSRl1MzABHtFGfbU8hPKbZujtaiqexNz3XrMTPD4qcPr_-O1S__Jcox4Nlk-t","share_title":"Icon buttons \u2013 Material Design 3"},"description":"Icon buttons help people take supplementary actions with a single tap."},{"slug":"components/fab-menu","metadata":{"keywords":"FAB menu, Material, Material Design, Google Material, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, Material Design Components, Material Components, components","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"The floating action button (FAB) menu opens from a FAB to display multiple related actions","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/KhRPygbtGBcZarqJE05zq9z1P3CwNUdN_lQQ2zP8AqXIVBK3zS216BhpCAU7gCstvITnD9KZOwrzCiHZnOYTMNCWWGPMrgtzV6dP_PyWMLix3mNopw=w1800","share_title":"FAB menu - Material Design 3"},"description":"The floating action button (FAB) menu opens from a FAB to display multiple related actions"},{"slug":"components/dialogs","metadata":{"keywords":"Material, Material Design, Google Material, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, Material Design Components, Material Components, components, dialogs","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Dialogs provide important prompts in a user flow. Use dialogs to make sure users act on information","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/mfskU6xDOqSsTCcgnGcsTfdCcT35ftTpCJmb4kuchYadG_41OF410XdGQP08L3iqFsq_pwIJ7_Zyf-8e-8J7nEwdNWMB-PqZGdICdnLsmHYfXy08Wrw","share_title":"Dialogs \u2013 Material Design 3"},"description":"Dialogs provide important prompts in a user flow. Use dialogs to make sure users act on information"},{"slug":"components/text-fields","metadata":{"keywords":"text field, form, survey, Material, Material Design, Google Material, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, Material Design Components, Material Components, components","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Text fields let users enter text into a UI. They typically appear in forms and dialogs.","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/WjHF4riC7maVlT9eNjGwcXpHUd9kVTpO91GpCEE252hvkP0kjcqSV-R_iD5Y4UlJ