","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Chips help people enter information, make selections, filter content, or trigger actions. Four types of chips are: assist, filter, input, and suggestion.","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/4cBoCPcD2kxFOPpph3XKIzBklwsMYwgbCZYK8H68fL0glQcFcClOttreYSnDpq7XEOsu5ozH0LJZSvU4fT0t56SKXGV_JLMNnlaa40Oe5D7upErTyMB5","share_title":"Chips \u2013 Material Design 3"},"description":"Chips help people enter information, make selections, filter content, or trigger actions. Use chips to show options for a specific context."},{"slug":"components/loading-indicator","metadata":{"keywords":"Material, Material Design, Google Material, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, Material Design Components, Material Components, components, Loading indicator, Loader, Circular loader, Linear progress bar, Circular progress bar, progress","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Loading indicators show the progress of a process for a short wait time","share_image":"","share_title":"Loading indicator - Material Design 3"},"description":"Loading indicators show the progress of a process for a short wait time"},{"slug":"styles/color/advanced","metadata":{"keywords":"Material, Material Design, Google Material, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, color, theme, theming, brand, branding, customization","meta_robots":" ","schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"From changing a component\u2019s default color mapping to creating additional color roles, advanced customizations fall within one of three general actions: applying, defining, or adjusting colors.","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/INXVYnVa50tm7-n5LPgAP0uQgk5IZZZmJ6Q4lJW24V52CtNk-xoOuV2cvYd8Et9rHqPiFIUDDt70jTj3D8Ax_9lcx8Ow0e4wqD4Uc8-j-tkmscUgJsea","share_title":"Advanced color customizations \u2013 Material Design 3"},"description":"From changing a component\u2019s default color mapping to creating