ive, responsive, layouts, bidirectionality, rtl","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Design products that adapt to languages that read right-to-left (RTL)","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/FK4JXpfD6VunHGYFTDR1KEIXq9PNyCxosIWw2MdMYDi0vKlaz1cmbk3mYSZoREr-Hc4Yud16BDdT7cZkoG1FkRb1WQhaYzVMYbaip_ZA71QI9W6gpk-v","share_title":"Bidirectionality & RTL \u2013 Material Design 3"},"description":"Design products that adapt to languages that read right-to-left (RTL)"},{"slug":"foundations/layout/canonical-examples/overview","metadata":{"keywords":"Material, Material Design, Google Material, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, adaptive, responsive, layouts, canonical examples","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Canonical layouts are designs for common screen layouts across all window size classes.","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/as3_9omNh61f08mQpH-_HsjzM6TK8_2v12HnczfZFPu7qUU_3qE_LFYzoaaRa4LeRd5tdpxXFiorrlugLUXnIE55K6R174kW-GYH7IMXVtpqss_c5UF6","share_title":"Canonical examples \u2013 Material Design 3"},"description":"Canonical layouts are designs for common screen layouts across all window size classes."},{"slug":"foundations/layout/grids-spacing","metadata":{"keywords":"Material, Material Design, Google Material, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Material You, adaptive, responsive, layouts, grids spacing","meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"Grids and spacing organize content and actions for any layout","share_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/rj2mxQ2OOOkXBNSqH0v_EygOCSFiJ3gWHUimBMQ0rq0X1A-0ME7ENXaZ4oc_PBMpLU-doQF19kE3gp1zK0-MTbpsdyXV90A_A5dVqT_OMtI-NUtFlw","share_title":"Grids & spacing \u2013 Material Design 3"},"description":"Grids and spacing organize content and actions for any layout"},{"slug":"foundations/xr/design","metadata":{"keywords":"Material, Material Design, Google Material, Google, Material Design 3, Material 3, Mate